  "idea": "AI audio cleaner for freelance podcasters and video editors",
  "text": "If your client sent muffled audio, run it through this tool before editing. Freelance editors constantly receive hollow Zoom audio recorded on low-quality laptop microphones. Trying to fix harsh room resonance with stock equalizers leaves voices thin and triggers client revision requests. Descript Studio Sound reconstructs missing frequencies and isolates dialogue so it sounds like a studio recording. You save hours of tedious mixing on every project.",
